WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.635
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.103
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.104
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:06.372
According to a new poll,

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:09.575
President Biden's approval
rating dropped to 39%.

00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:11.477
But he's thinking
he can get that back up

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:15.215
once he's indicted a few times.

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.983
President Biden participated

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.785
in yesterday's
White House Demo Day,

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:21.620
showcasing new technologies
from across the country,

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.657
and was way
too easily impressed.

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:29.595
"Sir,
that's the office printer."

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:32.498
"Look at this thing."

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:34.667
Former President Trump
praised his daughter Ivanka

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.001
this morning ahead of her

00:00:36.001 --> 00:00:38.404
taking the witness stand
at his civil fraud trial

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:40.673
and called her, "my wonderful
and beautiful daughter."

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.408
Weird,
when his sons were testifying,

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:44.277
he didn't have much
to say about them,

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.112
but now that it's Ivanka,
he's talking to her

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:49.516
like she has medical power
of attorney over him.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:50.984
"My wonderful
and beautiful daughter

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.353
would never pull the plug
on her sick father.

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.854
I could recover.

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:58.491
A lot of people
are saying I could recover."

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.326
Ahead of Ivanka Trump's
testimony today,

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.594
former President Trump
complained in a post

00:01:02.594 --> 00:01:05.331
on Truth Social that the judge
and state prosecutors

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.734
were, "making me look bad."

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.535
And then he sprayed
his face bronze,

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:11.837
combed his ear hair
to the center of his head,

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:13.639
yanked his tie down
to his knees,

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:17.109
and left the house for the day.

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:18.544
During a hearing yesterday

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:21.447
of the UK's official
coronavirus inquiry,

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:22.748
a former aide said

00:01:22.748 --> 00:01:24.684
that then-Prime Minister
Boris Johnson

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:26.452
had asked at the start
of the pandemic

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:30.023
to be injected with Covid-19
live on television.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:32.124
Way too risky,
said his advisers,

00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:35.895
about putting him
live on television.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:40.366
The Boris Johnson photo
just getting laughs.

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:41.734
Just getting laughs.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.335
It's good every now
and then when you go,

00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:46.439
"Yeah, we're not the only one
who had one of those."

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:50.242
They had -- Other people
had one of those.

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:52.412
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
said in a new interview

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.714
that he plans to run
for president again someday

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:57.716
and added, "I loved
running for president in 2016.

00:01:57.716 --> 00:01:59.251
We came incredibly close.

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:00.953
We came within inches
of winning."

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:02.989
I guess in the same way
that the moon

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:07.293
is within 16 billion inches
of the Earth.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.995
Texas Senator Ted Cruz released
his new book yesterday titled,

00:02:09.995 --> 00:02:13.666
"Unwoke" How to Defeat
Cultural Marxism in America."

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.034
And if you really want
to be unwoke,

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:17.770
he also reads the audiobook.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:21.573
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.573 --> 00:02:23.109
New York Mets owner Steve Cohen

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:25.511
yesterday unveiled his plans
for a new casino,

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:27.980
hotel, and music venue
near Citi Field,

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.382
which is expected
to cost $8 billion,

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:33.052
or roughly $1 billion
times as much as

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.387
the average Mets ticket
in September.

00:02:35.387 --> 00:02:39.392
So much math in that joke.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:44.230
Not just math,
but then calendar.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.165
To get that punch line,
you had to do math,

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:51.070
then you had to do calendar,
then you had to do baseball.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:54.473
I can't believe it went
as well as it did.

00:02:54.473 --> 00:02:56.075
"People" magazine
announced yesterday

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:58.377
that it has named actor
Patrick Dempsey

00:02:58.377 --> 00:02:59.845
The Sexiest Man Alive.

00:02:59.845 --> 00:03:01.247
[ Cheers ]

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:03.749
You guys know we were
only supposed to set our clocks

00:03:03.749 --> 00:03:05.818
back one hour, right?

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.560
I will say,
I read that joke first,

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.795
and then I saw a picture
and I'm like,

00:03:16.795 --> 00:03:19.999
"Pretty [bleep] sexy."

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:22.769
I'm not complaining
about the pick.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:26.405
And finally, three pandas from
the Smithsonian National Zoo

00:03:26.405 --> 00:03:27.707
were returned to China today,

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:30.343
packed in a special crate
on a FedEx plane --

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:32.445
or as Southwest calls it,
Economy Plus.

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:35.582
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

